Production Operative Immediate Start Temp Perm - Start People - Venlo - 21 uur geleden geplaatst 
Start People 
Jobid=635946600511965691 (0.0323) 
As a Production Operator, you will work with different machines and make sure the glass is processed correctly. Operating and setting up production machines; 
Carrying out quality checks; 
Checking that the production process is running correctly; 
Taking on more responsibility within the production process. 
You will work an average of 38 hours per week in a 3-shift schedule. The shifts rotate between early, late and night shifts: 05:30-14:00, 14:00-22:30 and 22:30-05:30. On Fridays, the late shift ends at 23:00. The night shift starts earlier on Sunday evening because the machines need to be started. 15.92 gross per hour plus a 23% shift allowance, giving you €19.58 gross per hour; 
~€Full-time position with an average of 38 hours per week; 
~ Temporary contract with the possibility of a permanent contract; 
~ Choice between weekly or four-weekly salary payments; 
~ Free fresh fruit every day; 
~ For this position, we are looking for someone who already has production experience and wants to keep learning. Are available full-time; 
Are willing to work in 3 shifts; 
Have experience in a production environment; 
Work accurately and care about quality; 
Speak German, English or Dutch. 
Experience with production machines is a plus. Over het bedrijf 
At Scheuten in Venlo, glass is processed and worked on for different applications, from homes and hotels to large buildings and special projects. 
You will work in a modern production environment with an international team. Do you already have production experience, enjoy working with machines and want to develop yourself further? Apply today as a Production Operator at Scheuten in Venlo!

SamenvattingAre you handy, do you enjoy working with electronics, and do you have an eye for quality? Then we are looking for production employees in Bleiswijk to help dismantle, clean, test, and assemble returned products. Good work!Over de functieIn this role, you will work with returned equipment and be responsible for:
dismantling modems, routers, and components;
cleaning parts and devices;
testing components and complete products;
assembling refurbished devices;
accurately recording test results.

At this company, you will work from Monday to Friday, from 07:30 to 16:30.
Over het bedrijfThe company you will be working for provides integrated logistics solutions with a strong focus on sustainability and circularity. They process returns efficiently and help customers maximize the value and usability of their devices.
Wat wij vragenYou are energetic and able to stay on your feet throughout a full working day;
You have an interest in electronics and technical tasks;
You have a good command of English;
You work accurately and perform well in a team.

Wat wij biedenAn attractive gross hourly wage of €15.26;
8.33% holiday allowance and 25 paid vacation days per year;
Travel allowance of €0.23 per kilometre;
A strong chance of receiving a permanent contract after 6 months;
Realistic opportunities for growth and development;
A pleasant working environment within a fast-growing organisation.

Meer informatieAre you ready to start as a production employee in Bleiswijk? You can apply in as little as 2 minutes.
Do you have any questions? Our team will be happy to assist you at +31 10 322 0177 or via denhaag-west@carriere.com
